# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opel_Corsa
# Vauxhall Corsa C: launched in the UK in October 2000; production 2000-2006.
# UK registrations 84,514 (2000) to 108,387 (2003); the UK's second
# best-selling car in 2002, 2003 and 2004 and best-selling supermini 2001-2005.
#
# Colours: Star Silver, Ultra Blue, Black Sapphire, Flame Red. These are the
# four largest DVSA shares for 2000-2006 registrations: silver 29-34%, blue
# 23-25%, black 9-20%, red 7-13%. Paint names are Vauxhall marketing names for
# the approximate shades; the render values are approximations, not paint codes.
#
# Dates are staggered per colour. Weights total 60 against the Focus's 99,
# reflecting 105k versus 150k sales.

